# Company A, Kochi — Holiday Operations & Direct Booking Platform

> [!NOTE]
> **Client Overview**: Tour operator based in Kochi, Kerala. 48 staff, ₹28–34 crore annual revenue, ~4,300 bookings per year across 60 curated Kerala and South India packages.

---

## 1. Executive Summary & Revenue Recovery Impact

The legacy setup relied on a 6-year-old freelancer website where every package or price update cost **₹3,000** and took **3 days**. Enquiries arrived across multiple disconnected channels (WhatsApp, Web forms, Email, Phone) and sat in Excel sheets, leading to average response delays exceeding 12 hours.

