## 3. End-to-End Architectural Architecture (8 Screens)

### 1. Public Destination & Package Explorer
- Live search by keyword, destination region (Kerala Backwaters & Hills vs Tamil Nadu & South India), duration (4-5 days vs 6+ days), and style (Family, Honeymoon, Heritage).
- Package cards displaying duration, route chips, star ratings, and transparent starting prices stating per-person twin sharing basis and 5% GST extra.

### 2. Public Detailed Package Page (`PKG-KL-07` & `PKG-SI-12`)
- **Interactive Day-Wise Itinerary**: Collapsible daily breakdown detailing day activities, stay locations, and included meals.
- **Topographic SVG Route Map**: Interactive visual schematic tracing the journey (Cochin ➔ Munnar ➔ Thekkady ➔ Alleppey ➔ Marari ➔ Cochin).
- **Curated Stays**: Transparent hotel list (Fragrant Nature Munnar, Cardamom County, Private AC Houseboat).
- **Seasonal Pricing Matrix**:
  - Peak Season (Oct - Mar): ₹32,500 per person
  - Monsoon Season (Jun - Sep): ₹24,900 per person
  - Summer Season (Apr - May): ₹28,400 per person
- Inclusions and Exclusions itemization.
- Sticky Booking & Enquiry trigger card.

### 3. Enquiry Capture & Multi-Channel Ingestion
- Universal enquiry modal accessible from every package and public page.
- **Channel Simulator**: Supports Web Form, WhatsApp incoming message simulator, Email ingest, and Phone logs.
- **Sample Enquiry Injection Button**: One click instantly tests the candidate prompt's exact requirement:
  > *"Hi, 2 adults and 1 kid, Kerala 5-6 nights in December, budget around 1.2 lakh total, houseboat a must"*
- **DPDP Act 2023 Consent**: Explicit personal data consent checkbox and WhatsApp updates consent toggle.
- **Instant Template Acknowledgement**: Dispatches immediate confirmation to the traveller guaranteeing a human response in under 1 hour.

### 4. Unified Admin Inbox & 1-Hour SLA Clock
- Aggregates inquiries from all channels into a unified priority inbox.
- **Real-Time SLA Countdown Badge**: Displays remaining time out of the 60-minute target:
  - *On-time (>35m left)* — Green
  - *Warning (15-35m left)* — Amber
  - *Urgent (<15m left)* — Red alert
- Status pipeline: `New` ➔ `AI Draft Ready` ➔ `Assigned` ➔ `Quoted` ➔ `Booked`.
- Staff assignment dropdown (Rahul M. - Kerala Specialist, Priya S. - Honeymoon, Arun K. - Editor, Founder-MD).
- Internal team notes section for recording hotel room checks and guest dietary preferences.

### 5. AI Co-Pilot Drawer: Side-by-Side Extraction & DB Matcher
- **Side-by-Side Layout**: Original incoming customer message on the left; structured AI-extracted fields on the right.
- **Human-in-the-Loop Correction**: If the AI makes an error, the consultant can edit any field (adults, kids, dates, budget, highlights) in one click.
- **Smart Package Matcher**: Evaluates catalog and ranks the top 3 best-fit itineraries with match confidence scores.
- **Strict DB Price Grounding**:
  > [!IMPORTANT]
  > **Zero Price Hallucination**: AI draft responses strictly query the package price table from the database (twin-sharing per person rate + extra bed + 5% GST). The AI never invents or guesses pricing.
- Consultant approval workflow: "Approve & Send to Customer" or "1-Click Quote Builder".

### 6. 1-Click Interactive Quote Builder & Printable PDF
- Pre-fills traveller details, package itinerary, and season tariff.
- Configurable adult count, extra beds for children, and optional experiences (Ayurvedic massage, Kathakali show, Houseboat dining).
- Generates transparent mathematical itemization:
  - Adults @ ₹32,500 pp twin share = ₹65,000
  - 1 Child extra bed @ ₹12,500 = ₹12,500
  - Taxable Subtotal = ₹77,500
  - Tour Operator GST (5%) = ₹3,875
  - Grand Total = ₹81,375 net (cleanly within Vikram Nair's ₹1.2L budget!)
- Creates a shareable URL (`https://companya-kochi.com/quote/QT-2026-101`) and printable branded quotation document with Kerala Government accreditation, GSTIN, itinerary, and terms.

### 7. Self-Service Package CMS with Version Rollback & Live Preview
- **5-Minute In-House Updates**: Non-technical staff can add new packages, adjust seasonal price tiers, and modify hotel choices.
- **Version History & Rollback**: Every update logs timestamp, author, summary, and snapshot diffs. One click restores any prior version.
- **Live Preview Mode**: Server-rendered preview toggle allowing editors to view the exact traveller page before publishing.

### 8. Travel Journal (Blog CMS) & SEO 140 Redirects
- **Blog-to-Package Conversion**: Blog articles feature embedded package cards at the footer, converting organic readership into booking enquiries.
- **140 Legacy 301 Redirects**: Complete mapping table redirecting old 6-year-old `.php` paths to modern clean URLs.
- **Live Redirect Tester**: Interactive tool to test any legacy URL and verify 301 permanent redirects.
- **XML Sitemap**: Canonical sitemap structure ready for Google Search Console.

